          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/2310f2691a1a44de8c49dd40250cd4e6_b02-ayer-compre-cafe.mp3?Expires=1794099540&Signature=h~XV1ZfcD-anpwgC04vG2WaQZ4wQrrPAShUB8W4Ub9Iva1xBpdqGJjNoGXDVqM2WqgaHn3c6f~5sY156lv4ZpTfaiHy2L8TBBoVaZQncwcTm3ZJotw7Kb1thJANHwJydQJJkfkAJzIU9NBvWKQ5sBsNwy7Qjz1aU2nCaVMPWu2N7DK2Myb9ngjtOMp-uwMXPo7u38cOAMDnoWci1av71Y1zPbI5FrOJrjpLdE9OOlQqtlma3ivPPKHmWpECgH~3M-7LDDMYWP60duanzyG6uafAQ5dy4cmHjwzI~0dljFO-m0Ur~3tTc85GBMmkv4ORzz3SoX77Yc3Jt~bN0Q-2-PA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
