    {
      "id": "92d94b57-7ba6-40db-82b8-f5780e7f332e",
      "title": "Escute o mini relato e observe como cada linha acrescenta só um detalhe.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "95fd4148-6166-4d2b-9a7e-8101aa6e2405",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute o mini relato completo.</p><p><strong>Ayer compré café.</strong></p><p><strong>Anoche salí tarde.</strong></p><p>Duas linhas como essas já contam o essencial sobre ontem sem alongar a escrita.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c9d8456a19a04366bfc0a106464f1403_b05-mini-relato.mp3?Expires=1794099540&Signature=RmeDASn31gspRjg0caw~lFu6tmeomQIiCCPR3f6YdEwfW0MJV98VsQA6awOogwegxMw93wQQvxpLfz4eiQJ1MO-K4H3rc2IHuHQr18tdLPVEBGlVHR4cnbJrF0OLaW7pMzDGMMufxOVfi~Ts2a5KVGCrHMB9tHRvpCIbROugKShWE-FQZBWdFRpvh7bCTkzLtF3ia8aY0MCYBPw20nU8jgKIDAN9RAb6CuizYqoz6Z7TfqitJjPoEsHSi-u64VzaQt~c~1bL7VyosV00m86R1di1LtbWCEPA8cURcraaYNfC7eDOMDCoG5ZRTS3XEydcdCCzXxBhfqBmj11A9Sx9rg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
